# Privacy Policy – Titan Art Puzzle

**Published by:** Groundnut Gaming House  
**Effective date:** November 24, 2026  
**Contact:** groundnutgaminghouse@gmail.com

## 1. Introduction

Groundnut Gaming House ("we", "our", or "us") respects your privacy.

This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you download, install, and play Titan Art Puzzle ("the App").

Titan Art Puzzle is a puzzle game designed for users aged 13 and above. The App does not require users to create an account, register, or sign in.

By using the App, you acknowledge this Privacy Policy.

## 2. Information We Collect

### 2.1 Information you provide

The App does not ask you to provide:

- Your real name
- Your email address
- A username or password
- An avatar or profile photograph
- Registration or account information

We do not operate a user registration or login system.

### 2.2 Locally stored game progress

The App uses Unity PlayerPrefs to save game-related information locally on your device, such as level progress and relevant gameplay settings.

This information:
- Is stored on your device.
- Is used to maintain your gameplay progress.
- Is not associated with a registered user account.
- Is not uploaded to a cloud-based player profile by us.

Uninstalling the App or clearing its application data may erase locally stored progress.

### 2.3 Advertising information – Google AdMob

The App uses Google AdMob to display advertisements.

Google Mobile Ads SDK may automatically collect and process certain information, including:

- IP address, which may be used to estimate approximate location.
- Advertising identifiers and other device identifiers.
- App interactions, such as app launches, taps and advertisement views.
- Advertising-related information.
- Diagnostic and performance information.

Google may use this information for advertising delivery, measurement, analytics and fraud prevention.

Google processes information according to its own privacy policies and applicable terms.

Google Privacy Policy:
https://policies.google.com/privacy

Google AdMob:
https://admob.google.com/

### 2.4 Puzzle content downloads

Titan Art Puzzle provides puzzle images and related content.

Some initial puzzle content is included within the App. Additional puzzle content may be downloaded from our content-hosting infrastructure as users progress through the levels.

When downloading remote content, standard technical information such as IP address and request information may be processed by the hosting or content-delivery provider to deliver the requested files and maintain service security.

We do not use these downloads to create user accounts or identify players by their real names.

## 3. How Information Is Used

Information processed through the App and its third-party services may be used for:

